Create a new directory called myfolder,mkdir myfolder
List all files in the current directory,ls
Show the present working directory,pwd
Create an empty file named notes.txt,touch notes.txt
Remove a file named old.txt,rm old.txt
Remove a directory named tempdir,rmdir tempdir
Copy file a.txt to b.txt,cp a.txt b.txt
Move file file1.txt to /tmp directory,mv file1.txt /tmp
Display the contents of file.txt,cat file.txt
Display first 5 lines of data.log,head -5 data.log
Display last 5 lines of data.log,tail -5 data.log
Count the number of lines in info.txt,wc -l info.txt
Change permissions to 755 for script.sh,chmod 755 script.sh
Change ownership of file.txt to user harsh,chown harsh file.txt
Search for the word error inside log.txt,grep error log.txt
Show running processes,ps
Show disk usage in human readable format,df -h
Show currently logged in users,who
Clear the terminal screen,clear
View manual page for ls,man ls
